WEBVTT

00:06:27.454 --> 00:06:30.329
lalu muncul bisikan-bisikan,

00:06:30.371 --> 00:06:31.746
tatapan itu,

00:06:31.746 --> 00:06:33.954
seringai, dan gelak tawa.

00:06:34.663 --> 00:06:40.538
Hingga kini, saya masih merasakan
kecemasan sosial karena pengalaman itu.

00:06:41.913 --> 00:06:43.496
Saya kehilangan harapan.

00:06:44.871 --> 00:06:47.788
Jangan khawatir, saya ikut terapi
agar baik-baik saja.

00:06:47.788 --> 00:06:48.996
Saya baik-baik saja.

00:06:49.038 --> 00:06:50.829
(Tawa)

00:06:50.871 --> 00:06:52.704
(Sorakan)

00:06:52.704 --> 00:06:56.829
(Tepuk tangan)

00:06:56.871 --> 00:06:58.788
Namun, saya merasa cukup.

00:06:58.788 --> 00:07:00.413
Saya seorang ilmuwan